{"id":"H2301","lemma":"חֲדַד","transliteration":"chadad","sayIt":"cha-DAD","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Hadad","meaning":"A man of the Arabs living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.25.15;\nson of: Ishmael (H3458);\nbrother of: Nebaioth (H5032), Kedar (H6938), Adbeel (H0110), Mibsam (H4017), Mishma (H4927), Dumah (H1746), Massa (H4854), Tema (H8485), Jetur (H3195), Naphish (H5305), Kedemah (H6929) and Mahalath (H4258)\nAnother spelling of cha.dar (חֲדַר \"Hadad\" H2301)\n§ Hadad = \"mighty\"\na son of Ishmael","glosses":["hadad"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-25","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hadad"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hadad","kjv":"Hadad"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 25:15","note":"Hadad, Tema, Jetur, Naphish, and Kedemah.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:30","note":"Mishma, Dumah, Massa, Hadad, Tema,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0110","lemma":"אַדְבְּאֵל","transliteration":"adbeel","gloss":"Adbeel"},{"id":"H1746","lemma":"דּוּמָה","transliteration":"dumah","gloss":"Dumah"},{"id":"H3458","lemma":"יִשְׁמָעֵאל","transliteration":"yishmael","gloss":"Ishmael"},{"id":"H5032","lemma":"נְבָיוֹת","transliteration":"nevavot","gloss":"Nebaioth"},{"id":"H6938","lemma":"קֵדָר","transliteration":"qedar","gloss":"Kedar"},{"id":"H4017","lemma":"מִבְשָׂם","transliteration":"mivsam","gloss":"Mibsam"},{"id":"H4927","lemma":"מִשְׁמָע","transliteration":"mishma","gloss":"Mishma"},{"id":"H4854","lemma":"מַשָּׂא","transliteration":"massa","gloss":"Massa"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}